li1: Tasks sidebar interface
	summary=The Tasks sidebar accepts task moves and section-control input and produces the current recent-task display.
	source=[DoingView.moveTask](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=moveTask), [DoingView.sectionHeader](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=sectionHeader), [DoingView.collapseButton](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=collapseButton), and [DoingView.draw](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=draw)
	reads=Task card, source column, target column, kanban configuration, and selected section state.
	produces=Move result, notice, and redrawn recent-task display.
	guarantees=A task move keeps the selected section state.
	rejects=A missing card or a move to the current column.
	check=Run the moveTask state test and npm run build.
ap1: moveTask
	summary=Move one sidebar task to another column and redraw the view.
