ds1: Collapsed column key set
	summary=The active view stores the keys of task sections that the user selected as collapsed.
	source=[DoingView.constructor](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=constructor), [DoingView.sectionHeader](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=sectionHeader), and [DoingView.collapseButton](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=collapseButton)
	representation=JavaScript Set on DoingView.collapsed.
	invariant=Only sectionHeader and collapseButton change membership; moveTask and data redraws keep membership.
ape1: moveTask section-state effect
	summary=The task move completes without a write to the collapsed column key set.
	source=Design from user request and [DoingView.moveTask](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=moveTask)
	representation=function
	definition=For different source and target columns, call moveCard, show the result notice, call draw, and return the move result; do not add or delete collapsed keys.
rvm1: Move result mapping
	summary=moveTask returns false for a missing card or unchanged column and otherwise returns the Boolean result from moveCard.
	source=[DoingView.moveTask](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=moveTask)
	representation=function
	definition=moveTask(card, from, to, config) equals false when card is absent or from equals to; otherwise it equals Boolean(moveCard(...)).
ued1: Section-state regression detection
	summary=A focused check compares collapsed membership before and after a successful move into a collapsed target section.
	source=[DoingView.moveTask](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=moveTask), [loadDoingView](../../test/doing.test.js?symbol=loadDoingView), and [doing.test.js](../../test/doing.test.js)
	representation=function
	definition=Fail when collapsed.has(target.key) differs before and after moveTask without a section-control event.
va1: Tasks sidebar state-preservation argument
	summary=The internal design keeps section state while a move updates recent task data.
	source=[DoingView.constructor](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=constructor), [DoingView.moveTask](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=moveTask), [DoingView.draw](../../src/views/doing.js?symbol=draw), and [doing.test.js](../../test/doing.test.js)
	argument=The collapsed Set is the only section-state store. The move effect does not write that Set. draw reads the Set to omit collapsed bodies. The focused check supplies a collapsed target, completes a successful move, and proves membership is unchanged. Therefore the interface keeps the selected section state while it redraws cards and counts.
ep1: Tasks sidebar collapse-state program
	summary=The Tasks sidebar keeps a collapsed target section collapsed after a successful task move.
